    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Comeback Jam!' is a 2D/3D single-player platform game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overcome hardships and adversities in search of the lost Jam with 'JamDragon'.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A slightly challenging adventure using ropes to jump over obstacles.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Jump over obstacles with a rope!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the rope to jump over obstacles and reach the goal.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The goal gets harder and harder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher the level, the harder it gets. Use the rope to cross more obstacles. Find the jam!</p>",
